WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.109 --> 00:00:04.539
Geppetto has to find Mr. Fox's puppet.

2
00:00:04.540 --> 00:00:09.569
Or Mr. Fox will ruin his

3
00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:16.162
business. Can Polly help

4
00:00:16.163 --> 00:00:20.675
him? Geppetto: I can't find the puppet

5
00:00:20.676 --> 00:00:24.711
anywhere! Mr. Fox will tell everyone I'm a liar.

6
00:00:24.712 --> 00:00:28.948
This is terrible. Jack:

7
00:00:28.949 --> 00:00:32.884
You have to tell Geppetto the truth.

8
00:00:32.885 --> 00:00:37.249
Polly: But he'll get mad at me.

9
00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:55.883
Jack: He's in trouble because you lied!

10
00:00:55.884 --> 00:00:58.872
Polly: Um. Excuse me.

11
00:00:58.873 --> 00:01:05.402
I hid the puppet in this drawer.

12
00:01:05.403 --> 00:01:08.350
Geppetto: Why did you do that?

13
00:01:08.351 --> 00:01:18.697
Polly: Because I broke it.

14
00:01:18.698 --> 00:01:29.095
I'm so sorry. And I'm sorry I lied. Geppetto:

15
00:01:29.096 --> 00:01:36.434
Hmm. The crack isn't too bad. I can fix it.

16
00:01:36.435 --> 00:01:38.725
Jack: You can?

17
00:01:38.726 --> 00:01:43.411
Geppetto: Yes. But you must promise something.

18
00:01:43.412 --> 00:01:49.239
You must always tell the truth. Polly:

19
00:01:49.240 --> 00:02:04.156
I promise!

20
00:02:04.157 --> 00:02:10.090
Jack: We're back in the barn!

21
00:02:10.091 --> 00:02:15.678
Wow! The wood is all stacked. Polly:

22
00:02:15.679 --> 00:02:19.292
I still have work to do. Omar:

23
00:02:19.293 --> 00:02:22.660
Laying hay in the coop?

24
00:02:22.661 --> 00:02:27.850
Polly: Yes, and telling Minnie the truth.

25
00:02:27.851 --> 00:02:36.898
Jack: Let's go, Polly! Bye, Omar!

